<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications fell 0.6 percent in the week ended June 20, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages rose 5.5 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages decreased 2.3 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 5.5 percent to 396.5 from 375.7 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index slipped 1.7 percent to 206.5 in the latest survey from 210.1 in the previous week  </p>
